        <item>
            <title>Version 3.2.3 (构建 33)</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 05:02:05 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.4</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <p>RateSync 3.2.3 新增多播放器接管规则，支持自定义播放器优先级和临时锁定来源。</p>
                <p>RateSync 3.2.3 adds multi-player takeover rules with custom player priorities and temporary source locking.</p>
                <h4>新增 / New</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>支持设置播放器优先级，多个播放器同时活跃时按优先级接管音频格式切换。</li>
                    <li>支持临时锁定音频来源，避免其他播放器抢占。</li>
                    <li>优先级和临时锁定入口放在实验性功能中。</li>
                    <li>Set player priorities and temporarily lock the active source to prevent competing players from taking over.</li>
                </ul>
                <p><a href="https://github.com/BiKing567/RateSync/releases/tag/v3.2.3">查看完整说明 / View full release notes</a></p>
            ]]></description>
            <sparkle:releaseNotesLink>https://github.com/BiKing567/RateSync/releases/tag/v3.2.3</sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
